@startuml
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
    usecase "View availability" as UC1
    usecase "Book room" as UC2
    usecase "Cancel own booking" as UC3
    usecase "Block or unblock room" as UC4
    usecase "Review usage" as UC5
    usecase "Send booking confirmation" as UC6
}

Student --> UC1
Student --> UC2
Student --> UC3
Administrator --> UC4
Administrator --> UC5

' why: R4 requires confirmation after a successful booking
UC2 ..> UC6 : <<include>>

note right of UC2
R1: Future start, duration > 0 and <= 2 hours
R2: Active bookings for the same room cannot overlap
R3: A blocked room cannot be booked
R4: Successful booking produces confirmation
end note
@enduml
